# mcp — MCP server
File: website/pulled/mcp.oot

Source: openOODA/mcp/docs/

## What it is

The Model Context Protocol server. Tag v0.6.10.
Twenty-two tools. Results wrap as
`{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"..."}]}`.
requiresCap 0 uses the session default. requiresCap 1 is
FsReadCap.
Host `mcp` over stdio. See `mcp/docs/MCP_SETUP.oot`.

## Surface

Tools from `mcp/docs/TOOLS.oot`:

| Name | Cap | Purpose |
|------|-----|---------|
| get_capability_graph | 0 | 14-token graph JSON |
| get_orientation | 0 | Codex text |
| read_board | 1 | One governance board |
| get_audit_log | 0 | Last N audit entries |
| get_board_index | 0 | Board list |
| summarize_board | 1 | Truncated board |
| compress_orient | 0 | Truncated codex |
| get_context_budget | 0 | Session counters |
| get_ooda_phase | 0 | idle/orient/decide/act |
| get_decision_journal | 0 | Audit slice |
| get_redteam_realtime | 0 | Live 8-gate fire |
| get_session_diagnostics | 0 | Session snapshot |
| get_format_constraints | 0 | RFC-0003 rules |
| validate_codex_format | 0 | Header and 256-line check |
| get_northstar | 1 | NORTHSTAR.oot |
| get_rules | 1 | RULES.oot |
| get_rfc | 1 | One RFC board |
| get_practice | 1 | REDTEAM, WORKFLOW, RELEASE |
| audit_compact | 0 | Drop old audit rows |
| estimate_tokens | 0 | Token estimate |
| token_status | 0 | Session token totals |
| token_ingest | 0 | Ingest a JSONL transcript |

Boards: ANCHOR, RULES, NORTHSTAR, RFC-0001..RFC-0006,
REDTEAM, WORKFLOW, RELEASE.
There is no `estimate_chars` tool.
